.&amp;rft.aulast=Wyatt&amp;rft.date=1961&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Annual+Review+of+Entomology&amp;rft.pages=75-102&amp;rft.volume=6&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A218693&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fsemanticscholar.org%2Fpaper%2Ff5218cb8d670def949b184b0a6ceeca464adb440&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1146%2Fannurev.en.06.010161.000451&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-:0-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-:0_3-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHagner-HollerSchoenErkerMarden2004\" class=\"citation journal\">Hagner-Holler, Silke; Schoen, Axel; Erker, Wolfgang; Marden, James H.; Rupprecht, Rainer; Decker, Heinz; Burmester, Thorsten. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/sim_proceedings-of-the-national-academy-of-sciences-usa_2004-01-20_101_3/page/871\">A respiratory hemocyanin from an insect</a>. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences. 2004-01-20, <b>101</b> (3): 871–874. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2004PNAS..101..871H\"><span title=\"Bibcode\">Bibcode:2004PNAS..101..871H</span></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.worldcat.org/issn/0027-8424\"><span title=\"國際標準連續出版物號\">ISSN&#160;0027-8424</span></a>. <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC321773\"><span title=\"公共醫學中心\">PMC&#160;321773</span></a>&#8239;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"可免費查閱\"><img alt=\"可免費查閱\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Lock-green.svg/20px-Lock-green.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail